      "statement": "PPH v1 (the wire-processing API Wire Center currently integrates with) is scheduled to sunset on 2027-03-31; migration to PPH v2 is tracked as backlog item CBO-4471 (34 points, unscheduled) and depends on CBO-4473 (CES account-filter mapping).",
