      "statement": "Of the identifiers associated with a wire, Wire Center persists cboRef (its own primary key) and pphId (returned by the PPH v1 POST), displays the Fedwire IMAD without persisting it, and does not have access to OMAD or UETR because PPH v1 does not expose them.",
