    {
      "id": "claim_7f1ae86b41b7492e8c45f8eb33067467",
      "statement": "Wire Center release actions require step-up authentication (EP-AUTH-01) plus client-configured dual approval above client thresholds, and search/activity-list results are filtered server-side (in the BFF) to the requesting user's entitled accounts using CES entitlement types WIRE_VIEW, WIRE_INITIATE, WIRE_APPROVE, WIRE_RELEASE, and WIRE_TEMPLATE_ADMIN; external sharing of client transaction data is not supported and would require an InfoSec design review under SEC-STD-22 plus a Privacy Impact Assessment.",
